# 13-shape set on a pixel grid -- pointer, I-beam, hand, hourglass, crosshair,
# the four resizes, move, forbidden and grabbing -- plus every alias apps
# actually ask for. A theme with only left_ptr in it falls straight through to
# whatever it inherits the moment you hover a text field.
